<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 13.21PCT FROM 13.10PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 13.21PCT FROM 13.10PCT.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Sept 30 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month rose to 13.21 from 13.10 percent on</p>
<p>Wednesday and the bid rate (Athibid) increased to 12.71 from</p>
<p>12.60 percent.</p>
